  "notes": "The native HLA_IMMEDIATE case passed before translation. The adapter supplies provider, FOM, endpoint, callback model, and logical-time implementation. After enabling then disabling Time Regulation, the tests send an ordinary interaction with the timestamped overload and observe one receive-order delivery. A provider may use the untimed callback or the timed callback with both order fields RECEIVE; callback overload shape is not claimed. This bounded observation covers neither other message families nor interoperability or conformance.",
